1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,960 --> 00:01:59,000
Ceng Niu ?

25
00:01:59,480 --> 00:02:00,520
Brother Wang !

26
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:04,440
Wang Lin,

27
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:06,840
long time no see.

28
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:10,360
I see your cultivation has improved greatly.

29
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:19,360
It has yet to match my handsomeness...

30
00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,080
I will let you borrow

31
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:23,320
that straw hat for a while longer.

32
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:25,920
There are still 99 wood carvings left.

33
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:28,960
Don’t forget them when you reach Soul Formation !

34
00:02:29,480 --> 00:02:31,640
Here are the carvings of Senior

35
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:33,400
I promised to give you.

36
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,400
I want to thank you

37
00:02:35,920 --> 00:02:37,040
for your past guidance.

38
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:40,080
Now, I just want to reclaim my soul strand,

39
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,160
nothing more.

40
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:53,440
Yunque Zi, an Ascendant cultivator, entered the Suzaku Tomb.

41
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:57,080
That means something else is happening here.

42
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,400
I must reclaim my soul strand

43
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,240
and avoid getting involved.

44
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,960
Wang Lin...

45
00:03:08,640 --> 00:03:10,120
You ruined my domain

46
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,720
so I will kill you !

47
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,640
I have faced countless enemies before,

48
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:30,040
but this kind of gaze that can make my heart tremble

49
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:32,760
can only mean one person.

50
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,920
Tu Si’s demon...

51
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,680
Tuo Sen

52
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,400
Once I leave this place,

53
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:48,920
even if you flee to the ends of the cosmos,

54
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:52,120
I’ll capture and refine you !

55
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:55,200
He should’ve attacked me on sight

56
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:57,320
to seize the memory inheritance.

57
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,560
But he hasn’t attacked yet...

58
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,240
Instead, he entered the Suzaku Tomb.

59
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:06,040
Does he also seek the Cultivation Planet Crystal ?

60
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:10,440
His cultivation likely surpasses Soul Transformation.

61
00:04:11,200 --> 00:04:13,050
The only person that can face him here

62
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,520
is Yunque Zi.

63
00:04:22,080 --> 00:04:23,880
The aura of an Ancient God ?

64
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:26,360
So it’s on him.

65
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:30,880
Look !

66
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,040
What’s happening ?

67
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:32,720
What’s going on ?

68
00:04:32,840 --> 00:04:34,240
The mountain is crumbling !

69
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:34,840
The gate...

70
00:04:34,840 --> 00:04:35,840
The gate has opened !

71
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:37,720
Break !

72
00:04:42,200 --> 00:04:43,520
Attack together,

73
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,120
we will open the mountain gate !

74
00:05:04,760 --> 00:05:07,840
Golden Sea\NSuzaku Tomb

75
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,440
As Situ said,

76
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:27,400
that must be Ye Wuyou’s tomb.

77
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,560
But entering it

78
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:32,560
definitely won’t be easy.

79
00:05:53,960 --> 00:05:55,400
A defensive restriction ?

80
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:09,440
Condense !

81
00:06:29,760 --> 00:06:31,600
With Tuo Sen’s power,

82
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,520
the puppet's cultivation

83
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,920
has indeed reached Ascendant.

84
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:49,880
Thank you Brother Wang.

85
00:06:50,920 --> 00:06:54,600
Zi Xin and I planned to use the Water Escape Technique to sneak in

86
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:56,280
but it’s impossible...

87
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:58,560
This golden-armored giant

88
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,840
doesn’t attack to kill.

89
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,920
To enter Ye Wuyou’s tomb,

90
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:06,160
you just need to withstand one strike

91
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,840
But this sword’s power...

92
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,840
Fellow cultivator Ceng Niu,

93
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,920
I'm sure you realized

94
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:16,520
that this strike is Ascendant-level.

95
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:19,120
None of us can withstand it.

96
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:21,880
Rather than wait for death here,

97
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:25,120
let the three of us join forces to resist it.

98
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,240
Brother Wang,

99
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:28,560
be careful.

100
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:32,880
Alright.

101
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:35,440
Very well.

102
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,280
Fellow cultivator Ceng,

103
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:40,240
the both of us will face the sword first,

104
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:42,040
then my Junior Sister will take over.

105
00:07:42,760 --> 00:07:43,720
What do you think ?

106
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,800
Don't trouble yourself,

107
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,880
I will face the sword first

108
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,120
and then you two take over.

109
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:02,840
Ceng Niu is only Early stage Soul Transformation yet is so presumptuous.

110
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:05,520
He must be relying on that Soul Flag again.

111
00:08:06,200 --> 00:08:08,520
If I can get my hands on it...

112
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,560
Fellow cultivator Ceng, don’t panic !

113
00:08:46,560 --> 00:08:47,680
Qian Feng is here !

114
00:08:48,200 --> 00:08:49,120
Ceng Niu,

115
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,000
prepare to die !

116
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:09,560
Asc...

117
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:11,400
Ascendant ?

118
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,600
This is bad !

119
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:19,120
Retreat !

120
00:09:21,520 --> 00:09:22,800
Passage of time.

121
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,560
Wang Lin !

122
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:51,560
Ceng Niu !

123
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:08,960
This must be the statue of the first Suzaku, Ye Wuyou.

124
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:10,840
That light...

125
00:10:11,760 --> 00:10:13,640
Could it be the Cultivation Planet Crystal ?

126
00:10:16,640 --> 00:10:17,400
However...

127
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,320
Where’s Yunque Zi ?

128
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:22,120
Wang Lin...

129
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:24,160
It’s you, right ?

130
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:26,440
Since you’re here,

131
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:29,440
lend me your strength.

132
00:10:43,840 --> 00:10:46,360
I wasn’t wrong about you.

133
00:10:46,920 --> 00:10:49,880
You’re the third to enter here.

134
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,160
Senior,

135
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,320
is this thing

136
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:56,040
the person who followed you ?

137
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:59,520
Just a fragment of his Divine Sense

138
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:02,760
is enough to have an Ascendant cultivation.

139
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:06,000
After fighting him,

140
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:08,640
I temporarily trapped him in this formation.

141
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,360
As expected.

142
00:11:14,800 --> 00:11:17,320
But the relation between Yunque Zi and Tuo Sen

143
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:19,040
seems to go beyond that.

144
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:21,720
It looks like

145
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:24,760
I still need to coax the truth out of him.

146
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,480
Wang Lin,

147
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,880
I’m gravely injured.

148
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:32,840
Could you get the Cultivation Planet Crystal for me ?

149
00:11:33,480 --> 00:11:35,520
For my Forsaken Immortal Clan

150
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,840
and for you cultivators

151
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:41,360
the Cultivation Planet Crystal must not shatter !

152
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,920
Senior,

153
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,320
who that person ?

154
00:11:54,680 --> 00:11:56,240
What is his relation with you ?

155
00:11:56,840 --> 00:11:58,240
If you don't speak,

156
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,680
Junior will not approach.

157
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:07,720
Fine,

158
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:11,120
I guess I can tell you.

159
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:14,040
I just learned that

160
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:17,040
he is the one that orchestrated

161
00:12:17,320 --> 00:12:20,480
the fall of planet Suzaku.

162
00:12:21,320 --> 00:12:25,040
Thousands of years ago, my clan was driven underground.

163
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,920
I carried their hopes

164
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:30,320
and infiltrated the country of Suzaku

165
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:32,680
as Qian Pinghai’s disciple.

166
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:35,720
I trained relentlessly

167
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:38,800
to become the next Suzaku,

168
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,800
restore my clan’s freedom,

169
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:45,440
and escape the eternal darkness.

170
00:12:46,520 --> 00:12:47,920
But I never imagined

171
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:52,120
that my Senior Brother would seize the position of Suzaku.

172
00:12:53,800 --> 00:12:57,080
After thousands of years of waiting,

173
00:12:57,560 --> 00:12:59,760
we ended up empty-handed.

174
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:03,160
Disillusioned with me,

175
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:06,640
Ancestor Xu abandoned hopes of peace

176
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:09,040
and activated the ancient altar

177
00:13:09,160 --> 00:13:11,760
to seek for greater powers.

178
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,600
Little did we know,

179
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:15,720
beneath planet Suzaku

180
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:20,640
lies the corpse of an Ancient God.

181
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:23,800
A strand of his Divine Sense

182
00:13:23,960 --> 00:13:26,520
answered our prayers

183
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,120
by helping Ancestor Xu to breakthrough

184
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:32,560
and shatter the first Suzaku's seal.

185
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,240
After that,

186
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:37,560
Ancestor Xu seemed to have gone mad

187
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:40,640
and he waged war on Suzaku.

188
00:13:40,640 --> 00:13:43,120
I just realized that

189
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:45,040
this war

190
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:47,840
was just a part of that demon's scheme.

191
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,280
All of this

192
00:13:50,520 --> 00:13:53,760
was a scheme to obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

193
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,560
Tuo Sen’s scheme to try to get

194
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,840
the Cultivation Planet Crystal

195
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,920
can only mean only one thing.

196
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,560
It can free him from the Blood Sea.

197
00:14:05,480 --> 00:14:06,880
If that is true,

198
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:09,520
I will not be able to escape him.

199
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:13,520
See for yourself with your Divine Sense.

200
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:16,960
I’m at my limit.

201
00:14:17,680 --> 00:14:19,480
If he escapes,

202
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:22,120
he will take the crystal.

203
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,240
When that happens,

204
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:27,440
all hope will be lost...

205
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,880
If Senior is at his limit

206
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,440
then why is your cultivation

207
00:14:42,240 --> 00:14:44,440
unexpectedly stable ?

208
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:48,400
How did you notice ?

209
00:14:50,280 --> 00:14:52,040
That’s not the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

210
00:14:52,760 --> 00:14:54,680
If you want this thing,

211
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:56,560
go ahead and take it.

212
00:14:57,600 --> 00:15:00,200
You're worthy of being one of my 4 candidates.

213
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:01,840
You're right,

214
00:15:02,240 --> 00:15:04,240
that isn't the Cultivation Planet Crystal.

215
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,680
That is only a shadow.

216
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:10,520
Touching it costs a high price

217
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:13,760
and reveals the location of the true crystal.

218
00:15:14,240 --> 00:15:15,600
I promise you

219
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,440
that if you retrieve the crystal for me,

220
00:15:18,680 --> 00:15:21,640
I’ll gift you my clan’s treasure.

221
00:15:28,320 --> 00:15:29,000
Senior,

222
00:15:29,640 --> 00:15:31,800
I want to learn how to use the straw hat

223
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,080
as a deposit.

224
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:52,920
Touch it.

225
00:15:53,520 --> 00:15:55,480
I don’t want to kill you.

226
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:58,040
But if you refuse,

227
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:00,440
I won’t hold back.

228
00:16:01,960 --> 00:16:03,400
You're my benefactor

229
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:05,640
so I'd rather not fight you.

230
00:16:06,360 --> 00:16:08,680
I just want to get my soul strand back

231
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,360
and leave planet Suzaku

232
00:16:10,600 --> 00:16:12,240
to pursue my own path.

233
00:16:12,840 --> 00:16:15,320
But since Senior threatens to harm me now,

234
00:16:15,520 --> 00:16:17,560
I'm pretty sure that if I touch this,

235
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:22,040
I will die for sure. Am I right ?

236
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,040
But your death

237
00:16:26,280 --> 00:16:29,160
will allow me to repair the Cultivation Planet Crystal

238
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:31,360
and save countless lives !

239
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,880
That is a righteous act !

240
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:36,440
If you’re so righteous,

241
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,640
then teach me how to do it

242
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:41,880
and die a noble death.

243
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,560
Ridiculous !

244
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:48,160
Do you think your Soul Flag can match me ?

245
00:16:48,160 --> 00:16:49,840
I’m no match for you.

246
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,440
But I know someone that is.

247
00:17:00,320 --> 00:17:01,720
Little guy,

248
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:04,440
that formation was quite clever.

249
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:08,760
Using remnants of dead soul fragments as a formation

250
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,440
can indeed trap Master's Divine Sense.

251
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:12,880
However,

252
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:16,440
I must obtain the Cultivation Planet Crystal for Master.

253
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:18,280
And no one can stop me !

254
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,560
A mere puppet...

255
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:23,760
As long as I can destroy your Divine Sense,

256
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,000
no matter how strong your true body is,

257
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:28,760
you won’t be able to get here now !

258
00:17:43,640 --> 00:17:45,760
Cultivation Planet Crystal

259
00:17:46,520 --> 00:17:47,960
The Cultivation Planet Crystal !

260
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:54,880
The day Master will be free is before me !

261
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:09,560
Tuo Sen's Ascendant puppet was killed in an instant.

262
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:12,640
The Cultivation Planet Crystal really is deadly.

263
00:18:17,760 --> 00:18:18,480
What !?

264
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,440
What is this place ?

265
00:18:25,040 --> 00:18:27,560
Celestial Seal Pagoda\NInside the Cultivation Planet Crystal

266
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,800
Are you

267
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,560
willing to become

268
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,760
the titled Suzaku ?

269
00:18:55,850 --> 00:18:59,150
To let go of the consequences of my actions

270
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:00,870
is to ignore the law of cause and effect

271
00:19:00,910 --> 00:19:02,810
like scattered ink.

272
00:19:03,690 --> 00:19:10,290
As destiny falls

273
00:19:06,530 --> 00:19:10,290
in exchange for this moment of tainted dreams.

274
00:19:10,290 --> 00:19:17,890
It makes the mountains lose their colors,

275
00:19:13,530 --> 00:19:17,890
wither and melt into rivers.

276
00:19:18,330 --> 00:19:25,450
Who can deceive

277
00:19:21,090 --> 00:19:25,450
the law of the heavens ?

278
00:19:25,770 --> 00:19:28,770
Countless generations

279
00:19:27,050 --> 00:19:28,770
have tried before me.

280
00:19:29,060 --> 00:19:32,490
But how could I not catch my dreams

281
00:19:30,890 --> 00:19:32,490
within my warm fingers ?

282
00:19:33,050 --> 00:19:36,570
You're at my side when I'm alone

283
00:19:36,570 --> 00:19:39,890
giving me the strength to fight the will of the heavens.

284
00:19:40,650 --> 00:19:43,850
Fortunately, my mind was open and honest.

285
00:19:44,210 --> 00:19:48,050
I'm sorry we never got to see the fireworks

286
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:48,050
in the streets.

287
00:19:48,210 --> 00:19:53,010
Can I break the vortex of our destiny ?

288
00:19:49,770 --> 00:19:53,010
Can I break the rules ?

289
00:19:53,020 --> 00:19:55,730
To run towards you !

290
00:19:55,770 --> 00:19:59,050
I will fight the law of the heavens and the law of cause and effect

291
00:19:59,050 --> 00:20:03,690
to cut down this tribulation with my own hands

292
00:20:03,690 --> 00:20:07,090
and break through the reincarnation cycle.

293
00:20:07,130 --> 00:20:11,770
All of that for the stars in your eyes.

294
00:20:12,220 --> 00:20:17,450
I wish to bend this dream for the fire in my heart.

295
00:20:17,570 --> 00:20:21,370
If your soul is willing to wander,

296
00:20:21,370 --> 00:20:26,010
can I still take your hands

297
00:20:23,050 --> 00:20:26,010
and hold them tight ?

298
00:20:26,170 --> 00:20:29,090
I will defy the heavens and prevent the stars from falling.

299
00:20:29,090 --> 00:20:33,970
I will overthrow the Immortals and the Demons in my heart.

300
00:20:33,980 --> 00:20:37,250
I dream of destroying

301
00:20:37,410 --> 00:20:41,970
the shackles of our fate.

302
00:20:41,970 --> 00:20:45,930
You're the only one that can ignore the law of cause and effect.

303
00:20:45,930 --> 00:20:48,730
You're the hardest to let go of.

304
00:20:48,810 --> 00:20:52,610
I want to be with you again

305
00:20:52,690 --> 00:20:55,970
so I can look in your eyes.

306
00:20:56,250 --> 00:21:01,210
Even for a moment, it's worth it.
